+/*
+ * neutron: experimental DXIL (Shader Model 6.x) front end for airconv.
+ *
+ * DXIL is LLVM 3.7 bitcode, which the LLVM 15 behind airconv still reads. The
+ * shader's function is moved into the AIR module as is and the dx.op.* calls
+ * are replaced with AIR equivalents. Resources declared in !dx.resources fill
+ * the same ShaderInfo maps the DXBC SM 5.1 path fills, so the root signature
+ * binding (dxbc_binding_rootsig.cpp) is shared.
+ *
+ * Scope of this prototype: compute shaders. Unsupported operations fail the
+ * compilation with a message naming the dx.op opcode.
+ */
